1429
01:45:07.749 --> 01:45:08.583
Ajju.

1430
01:45:09.083 --> 01:45:10.041
Go find him.

1431
01:45:11.333 --> 01:45:13.166
I want thirty students, a full thirty.

1432
01:45:13.833 --> 01:45:14.958
Go find him.

1433
01:45:16.916 --> 01:45:18.249
